        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude-crib" ana="#fromLatin" corresp="#wit-du">and let [his] offence against you be made manifest through the invocation of your name, Lord, which at the devil's instigation to be hidden from us . . .; but suffer the innocent and those free of this crime to be unharmed,</ab>
